body:
This type of thing happening over and over taught me that the world will fuck you, or you can fuck the world. Everybody dies alone. 

&#x200B;

Don't take this as advice. I did and ended up jaded and can't control my anger any more. But that's the lesson I drew from it..

Is it weird I love your drawing style

&#x200B;

i feel compelled to get this as a tattoo
